# Exp. 1 (b) b_twoplume3d -- case ${case}
# Eastern open boundary at x = 1 km: Stevens (1990) + U/V sponge.
# WHY NOT ORLANSKI (task-6 fix, brief task-6-fix-stevens-brief.md): the gate run
# b_3d_twolayer_x0_40 (3 h, np=5) ended OK but with domain-mean eta = 2.92 m
# against 0.18 m explained by the discharge, and a net normal transport of
# about -800 m3/s (INFLOW) through the OB u-points from t = 1-1.5 h on
# (Q0_total = 20 m3/s). Orlanski leaves the depth-mean normal velocity free
# and in 3-D it is unstable. Esteban approved Stevens on 2026-11-05.
# STEVENS: the depth-mean normal velocity is PRESCRIBED from OBEu.bin and the
# baroclinic part (previous-step boundary u minus its depth mean) is kept
# (pkg/obcs/obcs_calc_stevens.F:195-228, header lines 19-44); T and S are
# advected out with a phase speed and restored toward OBEt/OBEs on
# TrelaxStevens/SrelaxStevens (same file, OBCS_STEVENS_CALC_TRACER_EAST).
# OBEu.bin = Q0_total/A_ob eastward on wet OB faces (gendata/make_case.py,
# _b_stevens_east; ob_u_m_per_s, ob_area_m2 in case.json) so the discharge
# leaves exactly; OBEv = 0; OBEt/OBEs = initial ambient profile. Files are read
# only with periodicExternalForcing (pkg/obcs/obcs_fields_load.F:102): data
# sets cycle = period = 86400 s -> one constant record.
# TrelaxStevens = SrelaxStevens = 86400 s: MITgcm verification/exp4/
# input.stevens/data.obcs value.
# OB_Ieast=-2 -> column Nx-1 (pkg/obcs/obcs_readparms.F:671-672); column Nx
# is land (cases.yaml land_i_cols) so that the periodic x-wrap closes the
# domain at the ice face (west face of column 1).
# OB_Ieast is given for all Ny rows, including the two land rows
# Fortran j = 1, Ny = Python rows 0, Ny-1 (side walls). OBCS_CHECK (obcs_check.F:621-643) needs the
# inside mask = 0 at OB_Ie, true on land too, and demands an OB only where
# a wet U point leaves the inside mask, so the land rows are consistent.
# No north/south OB: the cross-fjord boundaries are closed walls.
# The U/V sponge (10 cells = 100 m of the 990 m wet length) relaxes toward
# the prescribed OB values. No useOBCSbalance: it balances only EmPmR, not
# addMass (pkg/obcs/obcs_balance_flow.F:300-315).
# OBCS_monitorFreq/OBCS_monSelect=0: OB statistics of uVel/vVel (max, min,
# mean, sd; pkg/obcs/obcs_monitor.F:102-122) are printed to STDOUT every 600 s.
 &OBCS_PARM01
 OB_Ieast=${ny}*-2,
 useOrlanskiEast=.FALSE.,
 useStevensEast=.TRUE.,
 useOBCSprescribe=.TRUE.,
 OBEuFile='OBEu.bin',
 OBEvFile='OBEv.bin',
 OBEtFile='OBEt.bin',
 OBEsFile='OBEs.bin',
 useOBCSsponge=.TRUE.,
 OBCSsponge_Theta=.FALSE.,
 OBCSsponge_Salt=.FALSE.,
 OBCS_monitorFreq=600.,
 OBCS_monSelect=0,
 &

 &OBCS_PARM03
 spongeThickness=10,
 Urelaxobcsinner=1200.,
 Vrelaxobcsinner=1200.,
 Urelaxobcsbound=60.,
 Vrelaxobcsbound=60.,
 &

 &OBCS_PARM04
 TrelaxStevens=86400.,
 SrelaxStevens=86400.,
 &
